  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「ナピアグラス」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8A%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2%E3%82%B0%E3%83%A9%E3%82%B9",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 106369344,
      "text": "ナピアグラス Pennisetum purpureum Schumach. はイネ科の植物の1つ。背が高くなる草本で、エノコログサを引き延ばしたような直立する黄色い穂がよく目立つ。牧草に用いられ、世界の熱帯、亜熱帯域に拡がっている。日本では沖縄でよく見られる。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Cenchrus purpureus」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cenchrus_purpureus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1368875018,
      "text": "Cenchrus purpureus, synonym Pennisetum purpureum, also known as Napier grass, elephant grass or Uganda grass, is a species of perennial tropical grass native to African grasslands. It has low water and nutrient requirements, and therefore can make use of otherwise uncultivated lands."
    }
